        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Besides, Jiangsu Xiaoniu has been listed in the Road Motor Vehicle Manufacturers and Products List (batch 327) issued by MIIT on January 13, 2020 as an enterprise permitted to manufacture motorcycles and we have obtained the World Manufacturer Identifier (WMI) and Vehicle Identification Number (VIN).",
