        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-044568",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "By maintaining a continuous connection with our vehicles and proactively interacting with users, we have established an instant feedback loop that drives an agile product development process.",
        "start_character": 34502,
        "end_character": 34693
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-044568",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-044568-2f6670df27714cae",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-044568",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-17",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Due to the legal restrictions on foreign ownership in companies that provide value-added telecommunications services in mainland China, we operate our NIU app, our website www.niu.com and other related business through Beijing Niudian, a mainland China company in which the equity interests are held by mainland China citizens.",
        "start_character": 612,
        "end_character": 939
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-044568",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-044568-2f6670df27714cae",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-044568",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For instance, we strategically use signature lighting designs to establish distinct product identities across different series, such as the iconic “Halo” headlamp.",
        "start_character": 37222,
        "end_character": 37385
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-044568",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-044568-2f6670df27714cae",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-044568",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In November 2015, we introduced NIU Cover, a service package designed to offer users comprehensive service protection entitlements.",
        "start_character": 21955,
        "end_character": 22086
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-044568",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-044568-2f6670df27714cae",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-044568",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to constantly improving and upgrading our Cloud ECU, we have developed our own System-on-Chip module, which to our knowledge is the first chip module specially designed and customized for smart urban mobility products.",
        "start_character": 29296,
        "end_character": 29526
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-044568",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-044568-2f6670df27714cae",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-044568",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-17",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we provide various services through our NIU app, including NIU Rescue and location of our service centers, and theft reporting.",
        "start_character": 19615,
        "end_character": 19755
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-044568",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-044568-2f6670df27714cae",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-044568",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The segment is growing rapidly, and we believe we maintain competitive advantages in a number of areas, including brand, product design and quality, smart features, omnichannel retail model, customer satisfaction, and a loyal customer base.",
